  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "At Crescent Lake, she stands beside Fairy Qing Suo in blue robes and Fairy Huang Sha in yellow garments as one of the Hua Hai three immortals. The three keep distance from Gui Wang and Loner Hong Yu; she and Fairy Huang Sha converse softly while glancing at those two with vigilant gazes. The same stretch treats them as righteous path Gu Immortals who still collaborate with the two demonic path immortals for Lang Ya Immortal Gu recipes. Watching the earthly calamity Endless Thunder and Lightning Rain, the sisters say that if the same struck Hua Hai blessed land, even their combined force might not resist it.",
      "chapters": [
        460
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_crescent_lake",
        "char_fairy_qing_suo",
        "char_fairy_huang_sha",
        "fac_hua_hai_three_immortals",
        "char_gui_wang",
        "char_loner_hong_yu",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "fac_lang_ya_sect",
        "sys_gu_recipe",
        "loc_hua_hai_blessed_land"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Deviation (recorded): this page uses the Northern Plains region field because chapter 460 places her at Crescent Lake during the Lang Ya raid. The chapter does not seat Hua Hai blessed land on a five-region map.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_northern_plains"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She is a coquettish girl wearing a pink skirt. She is beautiful and charming.",
      "chapters": [
        460
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "When it is her turn to throw green grape immortal essence into the holes, she holds a bead but hesitates, saying Long Hair Ancestor left white litchi immortal essence and that one hundred green grape beads cannot compare to one white litchi bead. After further rounds empty the land’s usable immortal essence, Gui Wang and Loner Hong Yu rush in first; the Hua Hai three follow in anger into Lang Ya blessed land. Inside the sea of clouds she exclaims that the scene is worthy of the Old Ancestor Immortal, while the sisters then fly separately toward three cloud buildings.",
      "chapters": [
        460
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "immortal-essence-and-entry",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_long_hair_ancestor",
        "loc_lang_ya_blessed_land"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Lang Ya land spirit had shown weakness on purpose, confined the five attackers’ rank five Gu in the cloud buildings, and captured them without using a desolate beast; they submit to save their lives. The land spirit teleports the five, including the pink-skirt immortal, to help refine stargate Gu for Fang Yuan under the Chang Shan Yin name, and they greet both the land spirit and Fang Yuan as Thieving Heaven Demon Venerable’s inheritor. When the land spirit proposes that Fang Yuan make Fairy Huang Sha dance or strip, Fairy Fen Meng and Fairy Qing Suo, normally close to Fairy Huang Sha like sisters, remain silent as if they had not heard.",
      "chapters": [
        464
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "capture-in-lang-ya",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_lang_ya_land_spirit",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_chang_shan_yin",
        "char_thieving_heaven_demon_venerable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After Fang Yuan refuses that proposal, Fairy Fen Meng and Fairy Qing Suo let out a breath of turbid air with complex expressions.",
      "chapters": [
        465
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "capture-in-lang-ya",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
